<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32034" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ-θλιψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>squeezing out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				342a15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2p.50U.
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λοιποῦ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῠρον</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>affliction, distress,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				12.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>ecthlipsis, ejection</i> of a letter, as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῆπτρον, σκᾶπτον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Conj.</u>
				230.10
			</span></i>, etc.; also, <i>elision,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				984.15
			</span></i>(pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
